  MyHealthOpinions — Healthcare Professionals mail system v1  ("Clinical Chart")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 03. Forgot password
  File       : forgot-password.liquid
  Class      : Auth — transactional, no unsubscribe
  Trigger    : Member asked for a password reset link
  Replaces   : forgot-password.liquid (MFR)

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Reset your MyHealthOpinions password
    2. {{ user.name.first }}, here is your password reset link
    3. Your password reset link (valid 24 hours)

  PREHEADER
    The link works for 24 hours. If you did not request it, nothing has changed.

  PLAIN-TEXT PART
    dist/text/forgot-password.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.

  Generated from src/content/templates.js + src/design/ — edit those and run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.
===============================================================================
